/-!
# KFX §5: the header of the uniform row addition

From the row-addition parameters on the background stacks `36 … 45`
(`[mC^k, K, e, t, S0, B, r, H, i, j]`) the header computes the master registers `σMR` of
`l13U`: the third row `h ∉ {i, j}`, the sorted rows `s0 < s1 < s2`, the slots `px, py`, the
factors `N0 … N3` of the shape `shR`, `Q = 2^{fK}`, `2^K`, `2^ρ` (`ρ = e % K`), the swap flags,
`gx`, and (by a halving loop) `A = zsz V`.
