`[m^k, K, e, t, S0, B, r, H, i, j]` in the background registers `36 … 45`, at cost
`≤ (Kc (K+2) + 1) · n · (r (H+1) (m^k + 1)^τ + PsiR r Z H)`.

`RowUCP m τ tab`: a fixed list of procedures and a code with `RowUC` in every extension
`IL.kTableP tab ext`.

**`rowUC_of`**: `16 ≤ m ≤ 10^6 → 0 ≤ τ ≤ 1 → IL.L12Canon tab l12 τ → RowUCP m τ tab`
